claim.claim-text:
a capsule (14');
a drum (20) of the capsule (14') comprising a wall defining a chamber;
an additional drum (74) of the capsule (14'), wherein the drum (20) is disposed within the additional drum (74); and,
a drive system (34) configured to: drive rotation of the drum (20) about a central axis (46) of the drum (20) and relative to the additional drum (74); and, drive forward or rearward movement of the capsule (14') along a track (12),
wherein the central axis (46) of the drum (20) is parallel to a direction of travel (16) of the forward and rearward movement of the capsule (14') along the track (12).
